From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:13:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1370/3799] soh: rename func_80AAF2BC -> EnMm2_RunAway

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: accelerates to speed 10 for sixty frames and then kills the actor; the state he leaves in once the race is settled.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c
index 4b13e5552..045db6fd4 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm2/z_en_mm2.c
@@ -179,7 +179,8 @@ s32 EnMm2_OfferTalk(EnMm2* this, PlayState* play, EnMm2ActionFunc actionFunc) {
     return 0;
 }
 
-void func_80AAF2BC(EnMm2* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AAF2BC: accelerates to speed 10 for sixty frames and then kills the actor; the state he leaves in once the race is settled.
+void EnMm2_RunAway(EnMm2* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->unk_1F6 > 60) {
         Actor_Kill(&this->actor);
     }
@@ -190,7 +191,7 @@ void func_80AAF2BC(EnMm2* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void func_80AAF330(EnMm2* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (SkelAnime_Update(&this->skelAnime)) {
-        this->actionFunc = func_80AAF2BC;
+        this->actionFunc = EnMm2_RunAway;  // was func_80AAF2BC [LLM:HIGH]
         EnMm2_ChangeAnim(this, RM2_ANIM_RUN, &this->previousAnimation);
         this->mouthTexIndex = RM2_MOUTH_OPEN;
         if (!(this->unk_1F4 & 2)) {
